
# Vercel CLI project link. Not secret, but this repo is public and a link
# file is local machine state, not source.
.vercel
.env*

# Working state, not source. CoWork and Terminal both use this for staging
# files during a task; a public repo is not the place for it.
scratchpad/

# Monday Briefing working files. The delivery encode is ~75 MB per edition and
# belongs in the Blob store, never in a public git repository - 33 MB of master
# plus a delivery copy every Monday is well over a gigabyte a year. The original
# recording is archived outside the repo and its sha256 is in briefings.json.
research/.media/
# QA renders of an unpublished edition. They carry PREVIEW placeholders and must
# never be reachable, globbed by build_check or walked by the sitemap.
research/.preview/
